# RentCity - Payment Gateway Environment Configuration

Copy this template to `.env.sandbox` or relevant environment configuration files.

## Backend Configuration (application-sandbox.yml or environment variables)

```properties
# Server Configuration
server.port=8081
server.servlet.context-path=/api

# Database Configuration
spring.datasource.url=jdbc:postgresql://127.0.0.1:5434/rentcity
spring.datasource.username=rentcity_user
spring.datasource.password=rentcity_pass

# JWT Configuration
jwt.secret=404E635266556A586E3272357538782F413F4428472B4B6250645367566B5970
jwt.expiration=86400000

# ============================================================
# PayPal Sandbox Configuration
# ============================================================
# How to get credentials:
# 1. Visit https://developer.paypal.com/
# 2. Go to Apps & Credentials
# 3. Switch to Sandbox environment
# 4. Copy Client ID and Secret from "Default Application" or create new app

paypal.client-id=YOUR_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID
paypal.client-secret=YOUR_PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET
paypal.mode=sandbox
paypal.api-url=https://api.sandbox.paypal.com
paypal.return-url=http://localhost:3000/payment-result
paypal.cancel-url=http://localhost:3000/payments
paypal.currency=USD

# ============================================================
# VNPay Sandbox Configuration
# ============================================================
# How to get credentials:
# 1. Visit https://sandbox.vnpayment.vn/
# 2. Register merchant account
# 3. Wait for approval and get TMN Code & Secret Key
# 4. Login to merchant dashboard to verify credentials

vnpay.tmn-code=YOUR_VNPAY_TMN_CODE
vnpay.secret-key=YOUR_VNPAY_SECRET_KEY
vnpay.api-url=https://sandbox.vnpayment.vn/paymentv2/vpcpay.html
vnpay.return-url=http://localhost:8081/api/payments/vnpay/callback
vnpay.command=pay
vnpay.order-type=100000
vnpay.currency=VND
vnpay.locale=vn
vnpay.timeout=15
vnpay.version=2.1.0

# Payment Service Configuration
payment.public-base-url=http://localhost:8081/api
payment.min-deposit-percent=50
payment.max-deposit-percent=100
```

## Frontend Environment Configuration (.env or vite.config.ts)

```bash
# API Configuration
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8081/api

# PayPal Configuration (if integrated on frontend)
VITE_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID

# VNPay Configuration (if integrated on frontend)
VITE_VNPAY_RETURN_URL=http://localhost:3000/payment-result
```

## Docker Compose Override (if using Docker)

```yaml
version: '3.8'

services:
  backend:
    environment:
      # PayPal Sandbox
      PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID: ${PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID}
      PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET: ${PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET}
      PAYPAL_MODE: sandbox
      
      # VNPay Sandbox
      VNPAY_TMN_CODE: ${VNPAY_TMN_CODE}
      VNPAY_SECRET_KEY: ${VNPAY_SECRET_KEY}
      
      # Payment Service
      PAYMENT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL: http://localhost:8081/api

  frontend:
    environment:
      VITE_API_BASE_URL: http://localhost:8081/api
      VITE_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID: ${PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID}
```

